      "year": 2005,
      "text": "In a communication network, a packet of length L bits takes link $L_{1}$ with a probability of $p_{1}$ or link $L_{2}$ with a probability of $p_{2}$. Link $L_{1}$ and $L_{2}$ have bit error probability of $b_{1}$ and $b_{2}$ respectively. The probability that the packet will be received without error via either $L_{1}$ or $L_{2}$ is",
      "options": [
