      "text": "Suppose you are asked to design a new reliable byte-stream transport protocol like TCP. This protocol, named myTCP, runs over a 100 Mbps network with Round Trip Time of 150 milliseconds and the maximum segment lifetime of 2 minutes. Which of the following is/are valid lengths of the Sequence Number field in the myTCP header?",
