      "text": "TCP client P successfully establishes a connection to TCP server Q. Let $N_{P}$ denote the sequence number in the SYN sent from P to Q. Let $N_{Q}$ denote the acknowledgement number in the SYN ACK from Q to P. Which of the following statements is/are CORRECT?",
